{"name":"8-5-2","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"sp2.2.4","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Battlefield","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Operation in progress. The sound of drone engines keep buzzing overhead."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That seems to be the last batch. You alright, RO?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"RO combs through her hair roughly with her hand and lets out a sigh."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Even though the commander is doing everything possible to protect us..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Judging from the engine noises from outside, the drones are still there..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Our ammunitions are almost depleted. If they go for another round..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Battlefield","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just bear with it for a little longer. From what I see, only three waves of enemies are coming our way. The Commander has already cleaned off most of them."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"SOP-II's download is almost complete, and we can retreat very soon."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is SOP-II... Will her neural condition be fine?"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I know we're not using external equipment for the sake of efficiency, but s